=Present the final response with below information:
Title: {{ $json.title }}
Summary: read the article content {{ $json.content }} and summarize it in a paragraphs of 120 words total. Make sure to include the details of the threat actor(if present), details on the vulnerability (if present), CVE ID (if present), CVSS score (if present) and methodology (if present) and tools used (if present). Threat Dynamics: Most importantly, check to see if a vulnerability has been exploited in the wild as per the article.
Remediation: Provide for any remediations, patches or techniques mentioned in order to stay safe from the attack. Summarise the same in 60 words or less. Add inference from your own in cases of mentions of OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, if no OWASP Top 10 vulnerability is mentioned in the article then don't add any statements to the summary. Also DO NOT add this line "The article does not mention specific remediation techniques or patches"
Reference:
{{ $json.link }}

